    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "utteranceId": 1,
    "utteranceClass": "statement",
    "atMs": 1790063572900,
    "textExcerpt": "I keep thinking about the Retri handler.",
    "textChars": 40,
    "textTruncated": false
  },
  {
    "event": "talker_reply",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "workerSessionId": "01a0c81a-5101-769e-b2fe-62611bcba768",
    "chars": 84,
    "excerpt": "What are your thoughts on it? We can discuss any changes or issues you have in mind.",
    "atMs": 1790063572900
  },
  {
    "event": "operator_utterance",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "utteranceId": 2,
    "utteranceClass": "statement",
    "atMs": 1790063583719,
    "textExcerpt": "It should not drop the session token after the third attempt.",
    "textChars": 61,
    "textTruncated": false
  },
  {
    "event": "talker_reply",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "workerSessionId": "01a0c81a-5101-769e-b2fe-62611bcba768",
    "chars": 102,
    "excerpt": "I agree, dropping the token could cause issues. Would you like me to relay that to the worker session?",
    "atMs": 1790063583719
  },
  {
    "event": "operator_utterance",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "utteranceId": 3,
    "utteranceClass": "statement",
    "atMs": 1790063595574,
    "textExcerpt": "Maybe the back off timing is measured from the wrong point.",
    "textChars": 59,
    "textTruncated": false
  },
  {
    "event": "talker_reply",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "workerSessionId": "01a0c81a-5101-769e-b2fe-62611bcba768",
    "chars": 136,
    "excerpt": "That's a valid point. If the timer is starting too early, it would throw off the sequence. Would you like me to send that to the worker?",
    "atMs": 1790063595574
  },
  {
    "event": "operator_utterance",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "utteranceId": 4,
    "utteranceClass": "question",
    "atMs": 1790063605163,
    "textExcerpt": "What would you check first?",
    "textChars": 27,
    "textTruncated": false
  },
  {
    "event": "talker_reply",
    "laneId": "voice-slice-lane",
    "workerSessionId": "01a0c81a-5101-769e-b2fe-62611bcba768",
    "chars": 126,
    "excerpt": "I would check the exact point where the backoff timer starts relative to the failed attempt to see if the timing logic is off.",
    "atMs": 1790063605163
  },
